stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> disposition
    state disposition <<choice>>
    disposition --> unknown: missing or invalid recorded day
    disposition --> cleared: valid day and cleared status
    disposition --> passed: valid day and passed status
    disposition --> overdue: open deadline before Central day
    disposition --> today: open date equals Central day
    disposition --> soon: open deadline one through seven days away
    disposition --> upcoming: other future date
    disposition --> passed: open nondeadline before Central day
    upcoming --> soon: Central day reaches seven days before deadline
    soon --> today: Central midnight reaches deadline
    today --> overdue: Central midnight passes deadline
